附加署名要求 / Additional Attribution Requirement

中文：
在 MIT 许可证的条款之上，作者要求：如果您在您的项目或产品中使用、复制或修改本软件，
您必须在显著位置保留作者的署名
署名格式需包含以下至少一项：
- GitHub: 508364
- Gitee: x508364
同时，您必须在您的项目中保留本 LICENSE 文件的完整副本

English:
In addition to the terms of the MIT License, the author requests that:
If you use, copy, or modify this software in your project or product,
you must retain prominent attribution to the author.
The attribution must include at least one of the following:
- GitHub: 508364
- Gitee: x508364
Additionally, you must include a complete copy of this LICENSE file in your project.
